    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "GREETINGS FROM\nOrange County. California\nOrange County Airport, just north of the finest\nbeaches and yacht harbors in southern Cali-\nfornia - Newport Beach, Balboa Island, Laguna\nBeach - is now the 12th. busiest airport in the\nUnited States. The county itself is considered\nto be the fastest growing county in the United\nStates.\nColor Photo by Jack Green\nPublished \u0026 Distributed\nby Columbia\nH-5934\nColumbia Wholesale Supply, 11401 Chandler, North Hollywood, Calit.\n113166\nPLACE\nSTAMP\nHERE\nPOST CARD\nAddress\n2015.166.2171"
